OL,3,GNEWSADrivers told not to 'treat island 
OL,4,Aas racetrack'                          
OL,6,FA woman who lives near a road where    
OL,7,Ffive drivers admitted speeding says she
OL,8,Flies in bed at night "waiting to hear  
OL,9,Fthe crash" as speeding drivers pass    
OL,10,Fnear her home.                         
OL,12,FPaulette De La Haye, who lives near    
OL,13,FRoute Le Brun, St Martin, said it was  
OL,14,Ffrightening to hear speeding drivers   
OL,15,Fand the lives being put at risk.       
