OL,3,GNEWSADrivers told not to 'treat island 
OL,4,Aas racetrack'                          
OL,6,FThis week a magistrate sentencing five 
OL,7,Fmen aged between 18 and 20 who drove   
OL,8,Fbetween 60-68mph (97-109km/h) along the
OL,9,Froad, which is limited to the island's 
OL,10,Fspeed limit of 40mph (64km/h), said a  
OL,11,Fmessage "needs to be sent to the public
OL,12,Fthat they cannot treat the island as a 
OL,13,Fracetrack".                            
OL,15,FPC Ryan O'Neill said speeding was      
OL,16,Fdangerous and something the island's   
OL,17,Fpolice were "committed to reducing".   
